==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Smotherwing Butterfly}}
Smotherwing Butterflies can be found in areas of [[Death Mountain]] and [[Eldin Canyon]] with [[Scorching Climate]]s, often on the edges of lava lakes. [[Beedle]] also sells them at [[East Akkala Stable]] and [[Wetland Stable]]. Using one in a [[Cooking Pot]] with [[Monster Part]]s will result in a [[Fireproof Elixir]], which will grant [[Link]] [[Flame Guard]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] as an ingredient to make Gray [[Dye]].

