==Trivia==
* In {{TotK}}, [[Beedle]] says that the scientific name (i.e. [[wikipedia:binomial nomenclature|binomial nomenclature]]) for the Smotherwing Butterfly is ''Papilio vulcensis''.<ref name="TotK Beedle"/> ''[[wikipedia:Papilio|Papilio]]'' is a real genus of swallowtail butterflies which means "butterfly" in Latin, while the fictional specific name ''vulcensis'' appears to be derived from ''vulcano'' ("volcano") and ''[[wiktionary:-ensis|-ensis]]'', a suffix indicating a place of origin. However, the proper term as used in some real-life specific names would be ''vulcanensis''.

